{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Let The Bugs Out?</strong> is a roguelike where enemies are attacking an auction item you must protect, but they\u2019re afraid of you, retreating whenever they see one of their own get killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: keep the auction item safe while gaining experience and choosing random upgrades that enhance your speed, damage, or healing abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Action:</strong> Move strategically to protect the item while earning XP to keep up with the growing enemy threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480670/extras/bcd1bad41c9c637fb9205644f22f0da1.poster.avif?t=1774088914\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480670/extras/bcd1bad41c9c637fb9205644f22f0da1.webm?t=1774088914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480670/extras/bcd1bad41c9c637fb9205644f22f0da1.mp4?t=1774088914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade System:</strong> Earn XP and choose from a variety of random upgrades, allowing you to tailor your playstyle and overcome any challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480670/extras/c076205f9d4225eacb4159e9b807f610.poster.avif?t=1774088914\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480670/extras/c076205f9d4225eacb4159e9b807f610.webm?t=1774088914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480670/extras/c076205f9d4225eacb4159e9b807f610.mp4?t=1774088914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fresh Roguelike Twist:</strong> Unlike traditional roguelikes where enemies mindlessly attack, here the bugs grow cautious in your presence, turning their assault into a retreat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480670/extras/e39314e9a5097034e6bc3ed0bf2d8342.poster.avif?t=1774088914\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480670/extras/e39314e9a5097034e6bc3ed0bf2d8342.webm?t=1774088914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480670/extras/e39314e9a5097034e6bc3ed0bf2d8342.mp4?t=1774088914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Challenge:</strong> Every playthrough is different, with unpredictable enemy behavior and upgrade paths that keep the action fresh and engaging.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480670/extras/aa742535ac39e823e4d28dfd49822856.poster.avif?t=1774088914\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480670/extras/aa742535ac39e823e4d28dfd49822856.webm?t=1774088914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480670/extras/aa742535ac39e823e4d28dfd49822856.mp4?t=1774088914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why You'll Love It:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re looking for quick bursts of action or deep, strategic gameplay, <strong>Who Let The Bugs Out?</strong> delivers a unique, adrenaline-fueled experience that rewards smart movement and adaptive play. Get ready to defend, upgrade, and turn the tide of battle in this exciting new take on the roguelike genre!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3480670?t=1774088914","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3480670?t=1774088914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480670/99fb66e52a05ed053e8e514cb61e52568cd44f00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774088914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480670/99fb66e52a05ed053e8e514cb61e52568cd44f00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774088914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3631730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Let The Bugs Out?</strong> is a roguelike where enemies are attacking an auction item you must protect, but they\u2019re afraid of you, retreating whenever they see one of their own get killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: keep the auction item safe while gaining experience and choosing random upgrades that enhance your speed, damage, or healing abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Action:</strong> Move strategically to protect the item while earning XP to keep up with the growing en